{
    "title": "Parallel Space - app cloning",
    "description": "Clone and run multiple accounts of the same app simultaneously with ease using Parallel Space.\r\n \r\nAs a leading Android tool, it empowers over 200 million users to access multiple accounts on a single device. Enjoy enhanced privacy with the Incognito Installation feature, which makes apps invisible on your device to protect your privacy.\r\n \r\nParallel Space supports 24 languages and is compatible with most Android apps. Manage multiple accounts and safeguard your privacy with Parallel Space!\r\n \r\n\u2605 Log in to multiple accounts on one device\r\n\u2022 Maintain separation between personal and work accounts\r\n\u2022 Explore different game paths and level up multiple accounts simultaneously\r\n\u2022 Keep each account's data separate and organized\r\n \r\n\u2605 Protect your privacy with hidden apps\r\n\u2022 Safeguard sensitive apps in your private space, away from prying eyes\r\n\u2022 Enhance privacy with a secure lock feature\r\n \r\n\u2605 Effortlessly switch between accounts\r\n\u2022 Run multiple accounts at the same time and switch seamlessly with a single tap\r\n \r\nHighlights:\r\n\u2022 Powerful, stable, and user-friendly\r\n\u2022 Unique: Built on multiDroid, the first application virtualization engine for Android\r\n \r\n---\r\n \r\nNotes:\r\n\u2022 Limitation: Due to policy or technical limitations, some apps are not supported in Parallel Space, such as apps that declare the REQUIRE_SECURE_ENV flag.\r\n\u2022 Permissions: Parallel Space requires necessary permissions to ensure the proper functioning of apps added within it. Rest assured that your privacy is our priority, and we do not collect personal information.\r\n\u2022 Resource consumption: Most resource usage is attributed to the apps running inside Parallel Space. You can view specific resource usage in the 'Storage' and 'Task Manager' options within Parallel Space settings.\r\n\u2022 Notifications: For optimal notification functionality of certain social networking apps within Parallel Space, consider adding Parallel Space to the whitelist or exceptional list of any booster or task management apps.\r\n\u2022 Account conflict: For some social networking apps, each account must be associated with a unique mobile number. Ensure the provided number is active for the verification process during setup.\r\n\u2022 Pro exclusive: With the free plan, you can run two accounts simultaneously. Unlock the ability to run multiple accounts by upgrading to the Pro plan.\r\n \r\nCopyright Notice:\r\n\u2022 This app includes software developed by the microG Project.\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2017 microG Team\r\nLicensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\r\n\u2022 Link to the Apache License 2.0: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0",
    "descriptionHTML": "Clone and run multiple accounts of the same app simultaneously with ease using Parallel Space.<br> <br>As a leading Android tool, it empowers over 200 million users to access multiple accounts on a single device. Enjoy enhanced privacy with the Incognito Installation feature, which makes apps invisible on your device to protect your privacy.<br> <br>Parallel Space supports 24 languages and is compatible with most Android apps. Manage multiple accounts and safeguard your privacy with Parallel Space!<br> <br>\u2605 Log in to multiple accounts on one device<br>\u2022 Maintain separation between personal and work accounts<br>\u2022 Explore different game paths and level up multiple accounts simultaneously<br>\u2022 Keep each account&#39;s data separate and organized<br> <br>\u2605 Protect your privacy with hidden apps<br>\u2022 Safeguard sensitive apps in your private space, away from prying eyes<br>\u2022 Enhance privacy with a secure lock feature<br> <br>\u2605 Effortlessly switch between accounts<br>\u2022 Run multiple accounts at the same time and switch seamlessly with a single tap<br> <br>Highlights:<br>\u2022 Powerful, stable, and user-friendly<br>\u2022 Unique: Built on multiDroid, the first application virtualization engine for Android<br> <br>---<br> <br>Notes:<br>\u2022 Limitation: Due to policy or technical limitations, some apps are not supported in Parallel Space, such as apps that declare the REQUIRE_SECURE_ENV flag.<br>\u2022 Permissions: Parallel Space requires necessary permissions to ensure the proper functioning of apps added within it. Rest assured that your privacy is our priority, and we do not collect personal information.<br>\u2022 Resource consumption: Most resource usage is attributed to the apps running inside Parallel Space. You can view specific resource usage in the &#39;Storage&#39; and &#39;Task Manager&#39; options within Parallel Space settings.<br>\u2022 Notifications: For optimal notification functionality of certain social networking apps within Parallel Space, consider adding Parallel Space to the whitelist or exceptional list of any booster or task management apps.<br>\u2022 Account conflict: For some social networking apps, each account must be associated with a unique mobile number. Ensure the provided number is active for the verification process during setup.<br>\u2022 Pro exclusive: With the free plan, you can run two accounts simultaneously. Unlock the ability to run multiple accounts by upgrading to the Pro plan.<br> <br>Copyright Notice:<br>\u2022 This app includes software developed by the microG Project.<br>Copyright \u00a9 2017 microG Team<br>Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.<br>\u2022 Link to the Apache License 2.0: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0",
